# Cloudflare Pages response headers for the static export.
#
# This file is copied verbatim to out/_headers by `next build`. It replaces the
# `headers()` configuration that static export cannot apply: Cloudflare reads
# these rules itself and sends them on every route, including 404s and the
# hashed files under /_next/.
#
# Same four headers, same values as before. Still no Content-Security-Policy:
# the theme and reveal gates run as inline scripts in <head>.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
